  "provenance": "Stations read from the nationwide AdV SAPOS overview map 'GNSS-Referenzstationen' (Stand August 2025, zentrale-stelle-sapos.de; the LGLN portal only shows a northern excerpt, external_sapos_ni.refmap.png). All 44 red SAPOS dots in Niedersachsen+Bremen are kept (Netherlands and neighbouring-Land networks excluded). Each dot's pixel centre was converted to coordinates with a bilinear georeference (map tilt, lon/lat scale, and meridian convergence) calibrated on register-grade neighbouring SAPOS stations (NW/BB/HE/MV) plus surveyed EPN marks; leave-one-out accuracy about 1.5 km, so coordinates are given to 2 decimals. Borkum and Hohenbuenstorf keep their surveyed EPN positions (BORJ00DEU, HOBU00DEU). The network publishes only the VRS service, so the map is the roster and position source. Regenerated by scripts/regen_external_sapos_map.py.",
